{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_templates_templates_library", "label": "Microfrontend Templates Library (Doc)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/templates/templates-library.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_templates_templates_library_template", "label": "Microfrontend Template", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/templates/templates-library.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A working Module Federation project \u2014 correct build configuration, a sample exposed component and a matching CI pipeline \u2014 so a new microfrontend is deployable in minutes. The valuable part is the federation config plus the build settings MF requires (target: esnext, minify: false, cssCodeSplit: false), which are easy to get wrong by hand and produce obscure runtime failures. Templates come in host/remote pairs; picking the wrong one is the most common early mistake."}, {"id": "docs_templates_templates_library_marketplace_manifest", "label": "marketplace.json Template Manifest", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/templates/templates-library.md", "source_location": "Where templates come from", "source_url": "https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/documentation/blob/main/marketplace/marketplace.json", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The catalogue is assembled from marketplace/marketplace.json in the documentation repository, fetched at request time \u2014 so new templates appear in every installation, hosted and self-hosted, without an upgrade. Each entry declares name, framework, compiler, host type, entry point, repository and download URL; type and compiler double as the lookup key <type>/<compiler>/<provider> selecting which pipeline is injected. comingSoon: true shows a badged, unselectable entry."}, {"id": "docs_templates_templates_library_template_pipelines", "label": "template-pipelines Repository", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/templates/templates-library.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-pipelines", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Holds the provider-specific build-and-deploy pipelines injected at scaffold time, organised by <type>/<compiler>/<provider>. A template whose combination has no pipeline is still usable but no CI file is added. Also the place to copy pipelines from when bringing your own repository."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_templates_templates_library", "target": "docs_templates_templates_library_template", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/templates/templates-library.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_templates_templates_library", "target": "docs_templates_templates_library_marketplace_manifest", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/templates/templates-library.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_templates_templates_library", "target": "docs_templates_templates_library_template_pipelines", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/templates/templates-library.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_templates_templates_library", "target": "docs_microfrontends_create_a_microfrontend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/templates/templates-library.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_templates_templates_library", "target": "docs_microfrontends_versions_and_builds", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/templates/templates-library.md", "source_location": "Create from scratch", "we